  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Update with support for .net sdk 11\n          - Spectre integration: add ExtendedCommandSettings.TryGetFiles and TryGetDirectories batch validation for .NET 10 and .NET 11, returning absolute path arrays and aggregating validation errors for multiple candidates.\n          - Add predefined-root and single-absolute-root forwarding overloads for batch path validation, with XML documentation.\n          - Expose TryGetFile, TryGetFiles, TryGetDirectory, and TryGetDirectories as public static PathUtil helpers in the core package without Spectre dependencies.\n          - Retain the protected ExtendedCommandSettings TryGet overloads as backward-compatible wrappers over PathUtil, preserving signatures and caller-argument expressions.\n          - Update the file-based app template to call PathUtil directly; add core path-helper and compatibility regression coverage.",
